WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Position end-effector above the top-left of the cloth

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.600
Grasp the cloth at the top-left corner

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.000
Move the cloth up and to the left

4
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Release the cloth to unfold it

5
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.000
Complete Unfolding and Finalize Position
